<title>USA: House of Fabrics names Richey CEO.</title>
<headline>House of Fabrics names Richey CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SHERMAN OAKS, Calif 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>House of Fabrics Inc said it named Donald Richey as president, chief executive officer and a member of the board.</p>
<p>Richey, 53, succeeds Gary Larkins, 54, who was named to the newly created post of vice chairman last December.</p>
<p>Most recently, Richey was executive vice president and chief operating officer of Fabri-Centers of America Inc, a Hudson, Ohio-based specialty retailer with approximately 950 stores and $800 million in annual revenue.</p>
<p>The apopintment became effective April 1.</p>
</text>
